- **HTML**: The `input-container` div wraps the input and the SVG icon. The SVG icon is positioned absolutely to the right of the input.
- **CSS**: The `.input-container` class ensures the input and icon are inline-block elements. The `.icon` class positions the SVG icon to the right of the input.
- **JavaScript**: An event listener is added to the SVG icon to call a function when clicked. The function retrieves the input value and performs the desired action.

You can replace the `onClickFunction` with your actual function logic. This setup ensures the icon is clickable and positioned correctly next to the input field.

